WEBVTT

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:51.030
What's up with you?

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:54.370
<i>Toma?</i>

00:02:01.260 --> 00:02:02.180
Are you all right?

00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:04.680
We're heading to the hospital now.

00:02:06.530 --> 00:02:07.320
<i>Wait.</i>

00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:10.690
<i>Why is Toma...</i>

00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:26.220
Have you felt sick recently?

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:27.900
Any chronic illnesses?

00:02:27.900 --> 00:02:29.340
I don't think so.

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:32.300
She was healthy and working yesterday.

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:34.280
Could be anemia.

00:02:35.180 --> 00:02:36.800
Do you live with your parents?

00:02:37.450 --> 00:02:39.300
Well, um...

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:41.430
No, she lives by herself.

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:42.820
Is that so?

00:02:42.820 --> 00:02:46.230
I was thinking of having her admitted for now to run some tests.

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:48.850
<i>Admitted?</i>

00:02:49.530 --> 00:02:50.590
I understand.

00:02:57.950 --> 00:02:59.040
<i>Again...</i>

00:03:04.070 --> 00:03:06.520
The results'll be ready tomorrow.

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:15.190
You don't have your insurance card, do you?

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:17.840
I'll bring it tomorrow.

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:20.150
I'll be going now.

00:03:21.350 --> 00:03:23.320
If something happens, call me.

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:27.490
Where's my cell phone?

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:29.340
It looks like yours is broken.

00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:32.150
I'll come as soon as you call.

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:34.650
You don't need to worry.

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:37.660
We have a call button, so it'll be all right.

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:39.270
I know you do.

00:03:39.270 --> 00:03:40.200
I'm just worried.

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:43.830
See you tomorrow.

00:03:52.690 --> 00:03:55.910
<i>Could Toma be...</i>

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:03.340
They said you should rest for the next two to three days.

00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:06.050
But I'm glad you were able to leave the hospital.

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:10.220
We're here.

00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:15.000
Go ahead.

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:17.410
I'll bring up your mail.

00:04:20.630 --> 00:04:21.780
Welcome home.

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:23.840
Oh, right. Here.

00:04:24.550 --> 00:04:25.240
Your cell phone.

00:04:26.510 --> 00:04:27.820
I told you it was broken, right?

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:30.960
I got a replacement, so use this.

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:32.140
I transferred your data.

00:04:32.140 --> 00:04:34.090
What? But...

00:04:34.090 --> 00:04:35.420
Don't worry about it.

00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:40.420
Anyway, I finally heard your voice for the first time since yesterday.

00:04:41.230 --> 00:04:42.620
You've been pretty quiet.

00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:45.320
Is it because you haven't fully recovered yet?

00:04:46.070 --> 00:04:47.430
That's not it.

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:48.970
Why are you acting so stiff?

00:04:49.670 --> 00:04:51.640
You should try to relax.

00:04:52.320 --> 00:04:56.760
I heard that you might have some memory loss due to the shock of falling,

00:04:56.760 --> 00:04:58.190
but that's not the case, right?

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:02.660
What? How are you really feeling?

00:05:04.310 --> 00:05:07.580
I'm a little fuzzy.

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:09.260
Fuzzy?

00:05:11.850 --> 00:05:13.080
You're kidding, right?

00:05:13.730 --> 00:05:16.130
I thought you were just a little out of it,

00:05:16.130 --> 00:05:19.340
but maybe you should've stayed in the hospital, after all.

00:05:19.770 --> 00:05:22.340
Oh, I should be fine,

00:05:22.780 --> 00:05:23.630
I think.

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:27.880
Well, the test results said you were fine,

00:05:27.880 --> 00:05:29.560
but let's just keep an eye on things.

00:05:31.380 --> 00:05:33.310
Oh, mind if I make myself coffee?

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:35.310
I'll just use your kitchen.

00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:37.690
You want some too, right?

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:43.990
I put in plenty of sugar.

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:46.630
Thank you.

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:49.900
You don't have to thank me for everything.

00:05:53.710 --> 00:05:55.150
About dinner.

00:05:55.150 --> 00:05:57.690
I'm sure you don't want to eat out in your current state,

00:05:57.690 --> 00:05:58.880
so I'll buy something.

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:01.580
I noticed your fridge was empty.

00:06:01.580 --> 00:06:02.810
Thank you.

00:06:05.270 --> 00:06:06.800
Just take it easy.

00:06:16.870 --> 00:06:18.580
Blank, like I thought.

00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:26.970
A diary?

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:29.950
Where's the key?

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:45.770
Pluto?

00:06:46.900 --> 00:06:50.120
Is this my schedule for Pluto's Sheep?

00:06:52.340 --> 00:06:54.480
"Ikki at the back alley,

00:06:55.030 --> 00:06:56.360
4 PM"?

00:06:57.090 --> 00:06:58.280
Ikki?

00:07:02.390 --> 00:07:03.480
Here, too!

00:07:07.350 --> 00:07:08.310
What are you doing?

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:12.450
I was checking my schedule.

00:07:14.420 --> 00:07:15.230
Oh.

00:07:16.810 --> 00:07:18.370
All right! I'll make pasta!

00:07:19.700 --> 00:07:21.090
Just leave it to me!

00:07:21.510 --> 00:07:25.190
Honestly, I think it'll be better than Pluto's Sheep's.

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:28.160
Looks delicious!

00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:29.420
Looks?

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:31.080
It really is delicious.

00:07:31.080 --> 00:07:32.220
Try it.

00:07:35.740 --> 00:07:36.440
See?

00:07:37.030 --> 00:07:38.740
Eat the salad too.

00:07:38.740 --> 00:07:40.440
You need plenty of nutrients.

00:07:43.090 --> 00:07:45.290
I'll be heading home now.

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:47.260
I'm sure there're still things you're worried about,

00:07:47.260 --> 00:07:48.740
but I'll come to check on you again tomorrow.

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:53.030
Um, thank you so much for today.

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:55.690
Hey, there's no need to thank me.

00:07:55.690 --> 00:07:56.250
Well, see ya.

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:10.290
<i>I'm glad Toma was here.</i>

00:08:19.980 --> 00:08:20.770
Rain?

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:31.160
What's this?

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:41.330
Nothing today?

00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:45.010
Good morning.

00:08:45.010 --> 00:08:46.220
You're up early.

00:08:46.220 --> 00:08:47.170
Good morning.

00:08:47.610 --> 00:08:52.350
I was worried you might've called last night, but were you all right?

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:56.490
Yeah. I fell asleep in no time.

00:08:56.490 --> 00:08:57.930
Any changes?

00:08:59.130 --> 00:09:01.800
Nothing in particular...

00:09:01.800 --> 00:09:04.440
<i>So she's okay today.</i>

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:06.390
I'm glad.

00:09:06.390 --> 00:09:09.060
If you're feeling better, wanna go for a walk?

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:14.370
Do you know where the back alley is?

00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:17.500
The back alley?

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:19.160
Why do you want to go there?

00:09:20.940 --> 00:09:21.930
Never mind.

00:09:21.930 --> 00:09:24.710
The back alley is probably... that one.

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:26.340
Will you come with me?

00:09:26.880 --> 00:09:28.280
Of course.

00:09:28.280 --> 00:09:30.430
If you want to go, I'll take you.

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:33.340
I'm glad it stopped raining.

00:09:34.310 --> 00:09:36.710
It's pretty hot today.

00:09:36.710 --> 00:09:37.560
Yeah.

00:09:39.120 --> 00:09:41.720
You haven't been talking much.

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:43.440
D-Do you think so?

00:09:43.940 --> 00:09:47.720
I used to tease you and say you'd be cuter if you were quiet,

00:09:47.720 --> 00:09:50.090
but now that you actually are, it's a little troubling.

00:09:53.510 --> 00:09:57.070
The place you call the back alley has to be here, but...

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:00.980
Didn't you come here often?

00:10:00.980 --> 00:10:03.050
It seemed like you had memories here.

00:10:03.050 --> 00:10:03.960
Huh?

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:10.380
Toma, you seem to know a lot about me.

00:10:12.600 --> 00:10:13.310
Um,

00:10:14.500 --> 00:10:15.500
I'm...

00:10:17.910 --> 00:10:18.980
going out...

00:10:20.580 --> 00:10:23.400
with you, right?

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:25.910
Yeah.

00:10:28.620 --> 00:10:29.510
That's right.

00:10:37.510 --> 00:10:38.820
You're finally awake.

00:10:42.090 --> 00:10:44.080
You seemed really tired.

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:47.460
It was pretty hot yesterday.

00:10:47.460 --> 00:10:49.740
Or are you still feeling sick?

00:10:50.570 --> 00:10:53.610
No, that's not it.

00:10:53.610 --> 00:10:55.760
Do you remember yesterday?

00:10:56.550 --> 00:11:00.450
I think... we went to the back alley?

00:11:00.450 --> 00:11:03.530
Yeah, you started feeling bad after that,

00:11:03.530 --> 00:11:07.270
and you've been sleeping for almost an entire day since then.

00:11:08.070 --> 00:11:13.390
I had you rest at home and spent the night to keep an eye on you

00:11:13.390 --> 00:11:15.490
in case you got worse and needed emergency help.

00:11:17.430 --> 00:11:19.310
I'm glad nothing happened.

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:23.160
Sorry, let me rest for just ten minutes.

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:25.530
I'm tired.

00:11:26.550 --> 00:11:27.830
Really...

00:11:29.110 --> 00:11:30.220
tired.

00:11:39.360 --> 00:11:41.190
Okay, see you tomorrow.

00:11:49.380 --> 00:11:52.880
<i>What's hidden in here?</i>

00:12:06.570 --> 00:12:08.060
C'mon, let's go.

00:12:10.770 --> 00:12:11.760
Mr. Manager?

00:12:12.780 --> 00:12:13.470
Huh?

00:12:13.470 --> 00:12:14.740
I'm here.
That's strange.

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:17.680
Please don't scare me like that.

00:12:18.110 --> 00:12:23.290
After your departure, what reason could you have for coming back here?

00:12:23.950 --> 00:12:28.970
I apologize, but could you allow her to take a few days off from work?

00:12:31.400 --> 00:12:32.450
I understand.

00:12:32.450 --> 00:12:37.230
If that's the case, then I'd like to put her recovery first.

00:12:37.230 --> 00:12:39.310
Take your time to get better.

00:12:39.310 --> 00:12:40.310
Thank you.

00:12:40.310 --> 00:12:41.460
It'll really help.

00:12:41.810 --> 00:12:43.790
Here you go. Enjoy.

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:53.740
I heard you're not feeling well.

00:12:53.740 --> 00:12:54.760
Are you all right?

00:12:56.180 --> 00:12:57.040
Yes,

00:12:58.660 --> 00:12:59.780
somewhat.

00:12:59.780 --> 00:13:02.590
Did your plan for the first go well?

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:04.880
Give me the detailed report in the back alley again.

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:06.620
Hi, Ikki.

00:13:06.620 --> 00:13:09.360
We decided to have her take some time off.

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:12.440
Is that so? I hope you get better soon.

00:13:13.660 --> 00:13:14.530
Thanks.

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:15.920
Let's go.

00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:16.950
Okay.

00:13:18.470 --> 00:13:19.370
See ya.

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:24.300
I'm sorry I decided to have you take time off without asking you.

00:13:24.300 --> 00:13:27.050
But you're still not feeling your best, right?

00:13:27.050 --> 00:13:29.270
I don't think you should push yourself.

00:13:29.270 --> 00:13:30.210
Yeah.

00:13:30.630 --> 00:13:31.630
Um...

00:13:32.760 --> 00:13:33.420
Ikki...

00:13:39.720 --> 00:13:41.010
Stay here!

00:13:49.370 --> 00:13:51.480
<i>Did somebody try to...</i>

00:13:55.460 --> 00:13:57.280
Sorry. I lost them.

00:13:57.920 --> 00:13:58.680
Hey.

00:14:01.100 --> 00:14:02.030
Are you okay?

00:14:05.680 --> 00:14:07.760
Why don't you come to my place tonight?

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:14.800
This is your first time here, right?

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:17.520
You used to come to my family's house all the time.

00:14:18.800 --> 00:14:20.810
Sorry for forcing you to come here.

00:14:21.480 --> 00:14:23.340
I'm just worried.

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:24.390
It's fine.

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:26.640
Make yourself at home.

00:14:26.640 --> 00:14:28.840
I'll be on the computer.

00:14:29.360 --> 00:14:30.080
Okay.

00:14:33.150 --> 00:14:37.110
You can use those books or games over there if you want.

00:14:49.180 --> 00:14:53.170
<i>Shin... I guess we're childhood friends here too.</i>

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:57.920
<i>I wonder if it's always been the same since then.</i>

00:15:00.260 --> 00:15:02.050
I was wondering what you were looking at.

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:04.060
That sure is nostalgic.

00:15:05.790 --> 00:15:08.570
I'm going to get some papers from the university.

00:15:08.570 --> 00:15:10.350
I can go shopping on the way back.

00:15:10.920 --> 00:15:12.250
Do you want anything?

00:15:13.530 --> 00:15:15.320
Nothing in particular.

00:15:15.800 --> 00:15:16.680
Okay.

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:18.570
Then just wait here for me.

00:15:20.720 --> 00:15:21.550
Okay.

00:15:27.840 --> 00:15:28.570
Damn.

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:31.050
Again.

00:15:35.550 --> 00:15:36.970
Thank you very much.

00:15:37.930 --> 00:15:41.440
<i>There are some things I can't bother Toma for.</i>

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:44.480
<i>And if I hurry back, he won't worry.</i>

00:15:56.630 --> 00:15:57.380
Hey.

00:16:01.300 --> 00:16:02.630
We meet again.

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:06.240
You're...

00:16:08.120 --> 00:16:09.730
You don't have to be confused.

00:16:09.730 --> 00:16:13.290
It makes sense that you wouldn't know me.

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:18.370
But I am suspicious, aren't I?

00:16:19.520 --> 00:16:20.720
By the way,

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:24.010
are you going out with Toma this time?

00:16:25.090 --> 00:16:27.050
Looks like I'm right.

00:16:27.700 --> 00:16:29.980
I'm glad you're happy.

00:16:33.480 --> 00:16:35.120
But too bad.

00:16:41.340 --> 00:16:43.240
You're going to be killed!

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:46.390
Your life is almost over.

00:16:46.390 --> 00:16:48.240
Enjoy it while you can!

00:16:52.090 --> 00:16:53.500
What do you mean?

00:16:55.610 --> 00:16:56.990
Don't you get it?

00:16:56.990 --> 00:16:58.060
How pitiful.

00:16:58.060 --> 00:16:58.840
Hey!

00:16:59.440 --> 00:17:00.200
You!

00:17:01.680 --> 00:17:02.530
Wait!

00:17:06.170 --> 00:17:07.390
Are you okay?

00:17:07.390 --> 00:17:09.440
Y-Yes...

00:17:09.440 --> 00:17:11.390
Why did you go out?

00:17:11.390 --> 00:17:12.800
I told you it was dangerous.

00:17:13.520 --> 00:17:14.660
To go shopping.

00:17:15.320 --> 00:17:17.130
You could've asked me.

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:20.300
I'm sorry.

00:17:20.300 --> 00:17:21.850
You don't have to apologize.

00:17:22.490 --> 00:17:23.360
I know it was scary.

00:17:25.540 --> 00:17:27.670
But it's okay now.

00:17:31.620 --> 00:17:34.320
So you don't know who he is?

00:17:38.730 --> 00:17:41.420
Who... was he?

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:46.620
I'm sure you're tired.

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:48.730
You should go to sleep.

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:50.420
Yeah.

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:55.190
And if you want to go out, let me know.

00:17:56.000 --> 00:17:57.250
It's dangerous by yourself.

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:12.490
You're going to be killed.

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:20.090
<i>I'm glad...</i>

00:18:20.930 --> 00:18:22.570
<i>Toma is here.</i>

00:18:45.460 --> 00:18:46.350
What's wrong?

00:18:46.350 --> 00:18:47.930
You can't sleep by yourself?

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:51.440
Is this better?

00:18:52.160 --> 00:18:54.490
You can't be by yourself.

00:18:55.120 --> 00:18:56.820
T-Toma?

00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:00.940
Huh?

00:19:00.940 --> 00:19:02.480
Wh-What? Uh...

00:19:03.960 --> 00:19:05.750
Sorry. I was half asleep.

00:19:06.640 --> 00:19:09.550
I was dreaming of when we were in kindergarten.

00:19:09.940 --> 00:19:14.290
You could never sleep by yourself and would always come to me.

00:19:16.080 --> 00:19:19.150
Hey, you should struggle a little.

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:21.350
You don't want to be cuddled, right?

00:19:21.350 --> 00:19:23.000
U-Um...

00:19:25.990 --> 00:19:27.560
You're warm.

00:19:30.620 --> 00:19:31.720
So...

00:19:33.180 --> 00:19:35.120
I'm a guy too, so I can't guarantee anything.

00:19:36.660 --> 00:19:37.950
Okay, that's enough.

00:19:37.950 --> 00:19:38.990
Let's separate.

00:19:43.470 --> 00:19:44.430
All right.

00:19:44.430 --> 00:19:45.670
Let's go shopping today.

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:46.880
Huh?

00:19:47.730 --> 00:19:50.970
I thought I could take you back home after two or three days,

00:19:51.640 --> 00:19:55.430
but when I think about the flower pot incident and the weird guy yesterday,

00:19:55.430 --> 00:19:58.160
I think you should stay at my place for a while,

00:19:58.160 --> 00:19:58.680
okay?

00:19:59.100 --> 00:20:01.690
I'd appreciate that.

00:20:02.230 --> 00:20:05.770
Let's go buy whatever stuff you'll need to stay over.

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:24.770
I might... want to stay outside for this one.

00:20:24.770 --> 00:20:25.780
That's true.

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:27.730
You're the boyfriend, right?

00:20:27.730 --> 00:20:29.270
Come on in.

00:20:29.270 --> 00:20:30.640
Why don't you choose together?

00:20:30.640 --> 00:20:32.460
Oh, no, I'll...

00:20:32.970 --> 00:20:34.680
Let's see.

00:20:34.680 --> 00:20:36.590
These are popular right now.

00:20:38.480 --> 00:20:42.040
But this showy bra might suit you more, miss.

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:43.220
That's a little...

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:47.370
This rich roguish style might suit you too. It's very sexy.

00:20:48.380 --> 00:20:50.050
Just choose something.

00:20:50.050 --> 00:20:51.020
Um...

00:20:51.020 --> 00:20:52.610
Would you like to try it on?

00:20:53.860 --> 00:20:54.880
Try it on?

00:20:57.000 --> 00:20:59.180
That was surprising.

00:20:59.180 --> 00:21:02.270
Man, aren't you feeling self-conscious?

00:21:02.270 --> 00:21:04.050
If we weren't living together,

00:21:04.050 --> 00:21:06.190
I'd pick anything you'd want,

00:21:06.190 --> 00:21:09.090
but underwear will stay in your head, whether you want it to or not.

00:21:10.230 --> 00:21:11.510
I'm sorry.

00:21:11.510 --> 00:21:12.990
It's fine.

00:21:12.990 --> 00:21:16.890
I don't normally do this much shopping. I'm pretty tired.

00:21:17.480 --> 00:21:20.350
Sorry for making you come along.

00:21:20.720 --> 00:21:21.810
Why?

00:21:21.810 --> 00:21:23.780
I was the one who suggested it.

00:21:27.550 --> 00:21:29.700
I'll get something to drink.

00:21:30.270 --> 00:21:30.570
Yeah.

00:21:31.430 --> 00:21:32.360
Thanks.

00:21:52.940 --> 00:21:53.920
This is...

00:23:26.210 --> 00:23:27.500
I finally met you.

00:23:27.500 --> 00:23:30.980
We haven't had any chances to chat recently, have we?

00:23:30.980 --> 00:23:33.930
Even though I've been worried about your dangerous situation...

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:38.000
So I'll take this chance to talk to you more than ever!

00:23:38.000 --> 00:23:40.230
Um, what should we talk about first?
